    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astropark</strong> is an immersive single-player VR game that invites players to explore the wonders of our universe through hands-on, interactive experiences. <br><br><strong>Designed for ages 13</strong> and up, the game is set in a stylized space-themed park where each area represents a real celestial body\u2014such as the Moon, Europa, or Saturn. Players engage in science-based missions that include adjusting gravity, generating solar energy, launching rockets, and navigating planetary surfaces with rovers. <br><br>Every mechanic is grounded in real-world physics and astronomy, making it both educational and entertaining. Astropark features vibrant environments, intuitive interactions, and a guided progression system that helps players understand key scientific concepts. <br><br>The game is <strong>non-violent</strong> and designed specifically for solo play, making it ideal for classrooms, museums, or curious individuals eager to learn through virtual exploration.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astropark</strong> is an immersive single-player VR game that invites players to explore the wonders of our universe through hands-on, interactive experiences. <br><br><strong>Designed for ages 13</strong> and up, the game is set in a stylized space-themed park where each area represents a real celestial body\u2014such as the Moon, Europa, or Saturn. Players engage in science-based missions that include adjusting gravity, generating solar energy, launching rockets, and navigating planetary surfaces with rovers. <br><br>Every mechanic is grounded in real-world physics and astronomy, making it both educational and entertaining. Astropark features vibrant environments, intuitive interactions, and a guided progression system that helps players understand key scientific concepts. <br><br>The game is <strong>non-violent</strong> and designed specifically for solo play, making it ideal for classrooms, museums, or curious individuals eager to learn through virtual exploration.</p>",
    "short_description": "Astropark is a single-player VR game where you explore the Solar System through interactive, science-based missions. Adjust gravity, launch rockets, and discover real planets in a fun, educational, and non-violent space adventure.",
